<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Dutch/Swedish control of Irish telecoms.</title>
<headline>EU clears Dutch/Swedish control of Irish telecoms.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission said on Friday it had cleared a joint venture under which PTT Telecom BV of the Netherlands and Telia AB of Sweden acquire joint control of Telecom Eireann of Ireland.</p>
<p>&quot;PTT Telecom and Telia are not presently active in the Irish market and the concentration does not result in a direct change in market shares,&quot; the Commission said in a statement explaining its decision. -- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
